<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICG Comms initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICG Comms initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Linda Meltzer initiated coverage of ICG Communications Inc with a buy rating and a price target of $35-$45 in 12-to-24 months.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 17-3/8.</p>
</text>
